-- src:303 | c) Chủ động thu thập và cung cấp các tài liệu quy định trong hồ sơ bồi thường
-- src:304 | bảo hiểm thuộc trách nhiệm của bên mua bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm cho
-- src:305 | doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm quy định tại Điều 13 Nghị định này.
-- src:308 | d) Tạo điều kiện thuận lợi cho doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm trong quá trình xác
-- src:309 | minh các tài liệu do mình cung cấp.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(1)(a)-(d)
GIVEN `the act is needed for safety, to limit the harm, or on an authority's demand` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party to the claim` `An act under Articles 10 and 12`
`Article 12(1) — the duties of the buyer and the insured when an accident happens` `the act is needed for safety, to limit the harm, or on an authority's demand` MEANS
        (PARTY `the insurance buyer or the insured`
         MUST  `notify the insurer's hotline at once`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance buyer or the insured`
               BECAUSE "Article 12(1)(a): the insurer's hotline was not notified")
    RAND
        (IF   `the act is needed for safety, to limit the harm, or on an authority's demand`
         THEN FULFILLED
         ELSE PARTY `the insurance buyer or the insured`
              SHANT `move, dismantle or repair the damaged property without the insurer's consent`
              HENCE FULFILLED
              LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance buyer or the insured`
                    BECAUSE "Article 12(1)(b): the damaged property was moved, dismantled or repaired without the insurer's consent")
    RAND
        (PARTY `the insurance buyer or the insured`
         MUST  `gather and provide the claim documents that are the buyer's to gather`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance buyer or the insured`
               BECAUSE "Article 12(1)(c): the documents of Article 13 that are the buyer's to gather were not provided")
    RAND
        (PARTY `the insurance buyer or the insured`
         MUST  `help the insurer verify the documents provided`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance buyer or the insured`
               BECAUSE "Article 12(1)(d): the insurer was not helped to verify the documents")

§ `Article 12(3) — the advance, within 3 working days of the notice`

-- The clock starts on the day the insurer receives the buyer's or the insured's notice of the
-- accident. Fork F23: that is the first notice (the hotline call of Article 12(1)(a)), not the
-- written notice of Article 12(4), which may come up to 5 working days later.
-- src:317 | 3. Trong vòng 3 ngày làm việc kể từ ngày nhận được thông báo của bên mua
-- src:318 | bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm về vụ tai nạn, doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phải tạm
-- src:319 | ứng bồi thường đối với thiệt hại về sức khỏe, tính mạng, cụ thể:
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(3)
GIVEN cal                IS A `A working-day calendar`
      `the notice day`   IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 12(3) — under` cal `the last day for the advance, notice received on` `the notice day` MEANS
    `under` cal `the day` 3 `working days after` `the notice day`

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(3)
GIVEN cal                IS A `A working-day calendar`
      `the payment day`  IS A DATE
      `the notice day`   IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 12(3) — under` cal `an advance paid on` `the payment day` `for a notice received on` `the notice day` `is in time` MEANS
    `the payment day` AT MOST `Article 12(3) — under` cal `the last day for the advance, notice received on` `the notice day`

-- The duty itself binds only where Article 12(3) requires an advance (nd67-art12-13-claims.l4
-- computes which).
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(3)
GIVEN advance IS A `The advance under Article 12(3)`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party to the claim` `An act under Articles 10 and 12`
`Article 12(3) — the insurer must pay the advance` advance MEANS
    CONSIDER advance
    WHEN `none of the cases Article 12(3) lists` THEN FULFILLED
    WHEN `an advance of` amount THEN
        PARTY  `the insurer`
        MUST   `pay the advance on compensation`
        WITHIN 3
        HENCE  FULFILLED
        LEST   BREACH BY `the insurer`
               BECAUSE "Article 12(3): the advance on compensation was not paid within 3 working days of the notice of the accident"

§ `Article 12(4) and (7) — the written notice within 5 working days, and the 5% reduction`

-- Within 5 working days from the day of the accident, except for force majeure or an objective
-- obstacle, the buyer or the insured must send the insurer a written or electronic notice of the
-- accident. If they do not, Article 12(7) lets the insurer reduce the compensation for PROPERTY
-- by up to 5% (nd67-art12-13-claims.l4 computes the amount). Fork F24: force majeure or an
-- objective obstacle lifts the deadline for that notice altogether (the clause says "trừ
-- trường hợp", except where), rather than suspending it; LAW fork L4 (Law 08/2022 Article 19(3),
-- aid lines 441-444) agrees that a delay so caused cannot be held against the buyer.
-- src:335 | 4. Trong thời hạn 5 ngày làm việc kể từ ngày xảy ra tai nạn trừ trường hợp bất
-- src:336 | khả kháng hoặc trở ngại khách quan, bên mua bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm phải
-- src:337 | gửi thông báo tai nạn bằng văn bản hoặc thông qua hình thức điện tử cho doanh
-- src:338 | nghiệp bảo hiểm.
-- src:379 | 7. Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm có quyền giảm trừ tối đa 5% số tiền bồi thường thiệt
-- src:380 | hại đối với tài sản trong trường hợp bên mua bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm
-- src:381 | không thông báo tai nạn cho doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm theo quy định tại khoản 4
-- src:382 | Điều này hoặc sau khi xảy ra sự kiện bảo hiểm, doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phát hiện
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(4)
GIVEN cal                 IS A `A working-day calendar`
      `the accident day`  IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 12(4) — under` cal `the last day for the written notice, accident on` `the accident day` MEANS
    `under` cal `the day` 5 `working days after` `the accident day`

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(4)
GIVEN cal                                         IS A `A working-day calendar`
      `the notice day`                            IS A DATE
      `the accident day`                          IS A DATE
      `force majeure or an objective obstacle`    IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 12(4) — under` cal `a written notice sent on` `the notice day` `for an accident on` `the accident day` `is in time, given force majeure` `force majeure or an objective obstacle` MEANS
        `force majeure or an objective obstacle`
    OR  `the notice day` AT MOST `Article 12(4) — under` cal `the last day for the written notice, accident on` `the accident day`

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(4), 12(7)
GIVEN `force majeure or an objective obstacle` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party to the claim` `An act under Articles 10 and 12`
`Article 12(4) and (7) — the written notice of the accident` `force majeure or an objective obstacle` MEANS
    IF   `force majeure or an objective obstacle`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY  `the insurance buyer or the insured`
         MUST   `send the written or electronic notice of the accident`
         WITHIN 5
         HENCE  FULFILLED
         LEST   PARTY `the insurer`
                MAY   `reduce the compensation for property by up to 5%`
                HENCE FULFILLED

§ `Article 12(10) and (11) — telling the injured person, and paying`

-- (10) The buyer or the insured must tell the injured person (or heir or representative) what
-- the insurer paid for each harm to health and life. (11) The insurer must notify the buyer, the
-- insured and the injured person of the compensation for health and life, and pay it. Neither
-- names a period. LAW fork L1: the Law on Insurance Business, Article 31(1) (aid, lines 719-724),
-- sets 15 days from a complete and valid claim file where the contract sets none; that Law is
-- not encoded, so (11) carries no WITHIN here.
-- src:393 | 10. Bên mua bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm có trách nhiệm thông báo cho
-- src:394 | người bị thiệt hại hoặc người thừa kế hoặc đại diện của người bị thiệt hại biết số
-- src:395 | tiền doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm đã trả đối với từng trường hợp thiệt hại về sức khỏe,
-- src:396 | tính mạng theo quy định tại điểm a khoản 6 Điều này.
-- src:397 | 11. Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm có trách nhiệm thông báo cho bên mua bảo hiểm,
-- src:398 | người được bảo hiểm, người bị thiệt hại biết số tiền bồi thường thiệt hại về sức
-- src:399 | khỏe, tính mạng và thanh toán số tiền bồi thường quy định tại điểm a khoản 6
-- src:400 | Điều này.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(10)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party to the claim` `An act under Articles 10 and 12`
`Article 12(10) — the buyer must tell the injured person what the insurer paid` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurance buyer or the insured`
    MUST  `inform the injured person of the amount the insurer paid`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insurance buyer or the insured`
          BECAUSE "Article 12(10): the injured person was not told what the insurer paid"

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(11)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party to the claim` `An act under Articles 10 and 12`
`Article 12(11) — the insurer must notify the compensation and pay it` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurer`
    MUST  `notify the amount of compensation, and pay it`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insurer`
          BECAUSE "Article 12(11): the compensation for health and life was not notified and paid"

§ `Article 10(1) — a lost certificate`

-- src:263 | giới được cấp 1 Giấy chứng nhận bảo hiểm. Chủ xe cơ giới bị mất Giấy chứng
-- src:264 | nhận bảo hiểm phải có văn bản đề nghị doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm cấp lại Giấy chứng
-- src:265 | nhận bảo hiểm.
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 10(1), last sentence
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party to the claim` `An act under Articles 10 and 12`
`Article 10(1) — an owner who loses the certificate must ask in writing for a new one` MEANS
    PARTY `the vehicle owner`
    MUST  `ask in writing for a new certificate to replace a lost one`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the vehicle owner`
          BECAUSE "Article 10(1): the owner who lost the certificate did not ask in writing for a new one"

